zt6|a|Not separated in respect to place by anything intervening; proximate; close; as, immediate contact. ; Not deferred by an interval of time; present; instant. ; Acting with nothing interposed or between, or without the intervention of another object as a cause, means, or agency; acting, perceived, or produced, directly; as, an immediate cause.	j:dvr,79,6~dvr,79,6
zw5|a|Exempt; protected by inoculation.	j:20f9,86,3~20f9,86,3
